# What docker/Dockerfile's build doesn't need from the repository: build outputs, the history,
# runs, and what only the window, the site, the Academy or the brand use. The workspace's
# manifests and sources stay (cargo reads every member's), and docs/, jobs/, examples/ and
# tests/ too, which the program builds in.
.git
**/target
runs
.claude
academy
assets
circuits
crosscode
site
studio/node_modules
studio/dist
studio/src
studio/tests
studio/src-tauri/gen
python/dist
python/.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.so
**/*.pyd
